        "cooked": "<p>I was happy to use my sidekick app for something but i can't get it to work. I did the order Donnoer wrote</p><p>\"In the app, from middle-right, clockwise, put SS Tachyon, Termination Bunker, Termination AZ, Redeemer Fanatic, Termination Unity, Freedom Tower, and Progeny.</p><p>Then open Notes for each of them.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There is a post about restarting, I hope i can be part of this fun. Anyone else have teh same proplem/ solution.&nbsp;</p>",
